<title>GREECE: EU TRANSPORT MINS TO MEET IN BRUSSELS DEC 12-13.</title>
<headline>EU TRANSPORT MINS TO MEET IN BRUSSELS DEC 12-13.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union transport ministers will gather in Brussels on December 12-13 on maritime, air and land transport issues. Greece will be represented by Transport Minister Haris Kastanidis, the ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Among the issues to be discussed will be a proposal for a directive to tax heavy lorries for usage of specific infrastructure, civil aviation security and air traffic management.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
